  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Rhythmrot\" grew up scavenging in the Junkers district, always finding a beat amidst the scrap. His rhythm provided a much needed distraction to the survivors around him - as it was his families job to fix up cyro-suits and give them a new home in the field. Now, Rhythmrot uses that same rhythm to find weaknesses in enemy armor and lead his flock to victory.",
    "class": "Support/Breaker",
    "name": "Rhythmrot",
    "personality": "Manic, Resourceful, and Loyal. Rhythmrot's twitchy, drumstick-tapping exterior hides a sharp mind constantly searching for the next opportunity. He bounces with nervous energy, but his loyalty to his flock is unwavering.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Rhythmrot can identify weaknesses in enemy armor by tapping on it with his drumsticks. This reduces the target's armor and increases the damage output of allies by 15% for the next round.",
